igned}{x}_{2} & =x\\cdot {q}_{2} \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\sqrt{6} \\\\ 3\\sqrt{6} \\\\ \\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}]\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} \\\\ -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{2}+3\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{2} \\\\  & =4\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}_{2}}{4}=\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{4}=\\sqrt{2}.\n$$" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362115 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362116 13194139535700 true] [17592186362115 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362117 13194139535700 true] [17592186362115 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362118 13194139535700 true] [17592186362115 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362119 13194139535700 true] [17592186362115 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362120 13194139535700 true] [17592186362115 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535700 true] [17592186362115 1041 "selection" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362115 1104 #edb/ref 17592186362117 13194139535700 true] [17592186362115 1110 #uuid "94719a91-9b3b-50fe-94ae-429886da0ed6" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362116 1034 "4\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362116 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535700 true] [17592186362116 1111 #uuid "4c44a129-4f2a-54db-b411-e4e8e45776ff" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362117 1034 "\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362117 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535700 true] [17592186362117 1111 #uuid "bcfd9514-cac8-5ffa-b608-b4d24e82070f" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362118 1034 "6\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362118 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535700 true] [17592186362118 1111 #uuid "2db211d0-365d-511a-9dd7-819b59f2dcda" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362119 1034 "2\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362119 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535700 true] [17592186362119 1111 #uuid "69593fb5-7936-56ca-86e2-f32a8e096968" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362120 1034 "3\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362120 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535700 true] [17592186362120 1111 #uuid "465b63f6-8ce7-515c-9858-3d5665444500" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362121 1017 #edb/ref 17592186362122 13194139535700 true] [17592186362121 1089 "q-81105" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362121 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535700 true] [17592186362121 1100 "Given the orthogonal basis $B$ of ${R}^{2}$ and the vector $x$ below, find the value of $10{x}_{2},$ where ${x}_{2}$ is the second component of $[x]_{B}.$\n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -6\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}]},\\,x=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362121 1113 #uuid "635d95df-cb69-500d-9a34-b4738e046aa2" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362121 1145 "Let's denote the vectors of $B$ as ${q}_{1},\\,{q}_{2}.$ \n\nSince $B$ is an orthogonal basis, we have that $[x]_{B}=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]$, where ${x}_{i}=\\frac{x\\cdot {q}_{i}}{{q}_{i}\\cdot {q}_{i}}.$ Computing ${x}_{2},$ we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} & =\\frac{x\\cdot {q}_{2}}{{q}_{2}\\cdot {q}_{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\cdot 3+(-3)\\cdot (-1)}{{3}^{2}+(-1)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{15+3}{9+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n$$\n10{x}_{2}=10\\cdot \\frac{9}{5}=18.\n$$" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362122 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362123 13194139535700 true] [17592186362122 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362124 13194139535700 true] [17592186362122 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362125 13194139535700 true] [17592186362122 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362126 13194139535700 true] [17592186362122 1000 #edb/ref 17592186362127 13194139535700 true] [17592186362122 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535700 true] [17592186362122 1041 "selection" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362122 1104 #edb/ref 17592186362127 13194139535700 true] [17592186362122 1110 #uuid "009181d9-d4e8-5b9a-851a-cb85e53ac25a" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362123 1034 "\\frac{9}{5}" 13194139535700 true] [17592186362123 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535700 true] [17592186362123 1111 #u